    "expectedStatus": "NotEligible",
    "expectedOutput": "  [FX-04] One\r\n  Two\r\n  Three\r\n  Four\r\nColumn zero"
  },
  {
    "id": "FX-05",
    "purpose": "Too few margin-prefixed lines",
