    "expectedStatus": "NotEligible",
    "expectedOutput": "  [FX-05] One\r\n  Two\r\n  Three\r\n  Four\r\n  Five\r\n  Six\r\n One\r\n One\r\n One\r\n One"
  },
  {
    "id": "FX-06",
    "purpose": "Tabs and one-space prefixes are not the margin",
    "input": "\t[FX-06] Tab\r\n One space\r\n\tTab again",
